Subject: BIND RR compatability problem, exacerbated by sendmail, triggered by DCE config.
Date: 25 Mar 1995 11:20:35 GMT
Organization: Iowa Computer Aided Engineering Network, University of Iowa
Lines: 131
Distribution: world
Message-ID: <3l0ua3$75e@news.icaen.uiowa.edu>
